<!-- Captured verbatim from a Final Cut FCPXML export. Reuse as-is.

     History:
       * First authored from a specification, then re-captured after a hand fix
         (Nessebar, 2026-08-09) because a composed stroke rendered the type
         solid black.
       * RE-CAPTURED from the Berlin export (2026-09-01). The user restyled the
         title in Final Cut and moved it to the lower-left to sit under the
         relocated pin. What changed:
           - no longer bold — fontFace="Regular", the `bold="1"` attribute gone
           - the outside stroke is replaced by a drop shadow
             (shadowColor="0 0 0 0.8321", shadowOffset="5 315"); strokeColor /
             strokeWidth are gone
           - Position moved from "-637.15 444" (top) to "-593.38 -509" (bottom)
         The pin moved the same way — see location-pin-overlay.xml.

     The earlier black-glyph traps no longer apply to THIS style (there is no
     stroke here now), but they are why the whole element is captured rather
     than composed: the attribute names are DTD-declared, their values and the
     nested MotionSimpleValues param block are not derivable from the DTD.
     Treat it the same way as the keyer: capture, do not compose.

     Final Cut also emits <adjust-colorConform> on everything it exports. That
     element is FCPXML 1.11 and fails validation against the 1.10 DTD this
     project writes, so it is stripped here rather than carried through.

     `start="3600s"` is Final Cut's convention for generators, not an in-point.
     @@TEXT@@ is substituted with LOCATION_TITLE_TEXT. The Position is
     centre-anchored; dx/dy in a LOCATION_PINS entry shift it per name length,
     though at this lower-left placement the title no longer collides with the
     pin so dx is usually 0. -->

<effect id="r7" name="Basic Title" uid=".../Titles.localized/Bumper:Opener.localized/Basic Title.localized/Basic Title.moti"/>

<title ref="r7" lane="2" offset="3/2s" name="@@TEXT@@ - Basic Title" start="3600s" duration="151/30s">
    <param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="-593.38 -509"/>
    <param name="Flatten" key="9999/999166631/999166633/2/351" value="1"/>
    <param name="Alignment" key="9999/999166631/999166633/2/354/999169573/401" value="1 (Center)"/>
    <param name="disableDRT" key="3733" value="1"/>
    <text>
        <text-style ref="ts1">@@TEXT@@</text-style>
    </text>
    <text-style-def id="ts1">
        <text-style font="Helvetica Neue" fontSize="31" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" shadowColor="0 0 0 0.8321" shadowOffset="5 315" kerning="5" alignment="center">
            <param name="MotionSimpleValues" key="MotionTextStyle:SimpleValues">
                <param name="motionTextKerning" key="kerning" value="5"/>
            </param>
        </text-style>
    </text-style-def>
</title>
